        "string"
      ]
    }
  },
  "writing_rules": [
    "Static loadout composition belongs in game/data/martial-world/equipment-loadouts.json.",
    "Policy assignments are current conserved custody: assigning a person never happens merely because they qualify for a policy.",
    "An assigned person's item map stores only absolute quantity deviations from the static policy; zero is retained when a policy item is currently absent.",
    "Condition maps store only deviations from the policy/default full integrity of 1000.",
    "Unassigned person rows store only current positive item quantities and non-default condition.",
    "Do not duplicate faction, policy, status, empty stock, repair-project, or full-integrity defaults in hot state."
  ]
